<title>ITALY: Opening of Italy screen stock trading delayed.</title>
<headline>Opening of Italy screen stock trading delayed.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The opening of Italy's screen-based stock trading system will be delayed indefinitely for technical reasons, said a spokesman for Ced Borsa, the bourse's computer centre.</p>
<p>The spokesman said Ced Borsa would issue a statement at 1000 gmt giving a fresh progress report.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
